WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Be brave enough to split
the primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:39.640 --> 01:40.490
I know.

01:41.590 --> 01:43.180
I know what you're looking for.

01:43.430 --> 01:45.380
But I'm telling you, it's useless.

01:45.400 --> 01:46.930
I've been searching for it
over a century.

01:46.950 --> 01:48.540
I've tried every method.

01:48.760 --> 01:49.410
Give up.

01:55.400 --> 01:56.380
He's gone.

01:56.680 --> 01:57.620
No more digging for stones.

01:57.640 --> 01:58.460
Believe in the Sea Deity Sect!

01:58.480 --> 02:16.010
Believe in the Sea Deity Sect!

02:17.120 --> 02:19.340
I knew you were loyal and righteous.

02:19.630 --> 02:21.410
You wouldn't abandon me.

02:21.470 --> 02:22.730
There, there. Don't cry.

02:29.800 --> 02:30.450
Alright.

02:31.630 --> 02:32.570
Go on, talk to her.

02:32.910 --> 02:33.780
Mind your tone.

02:50.910 --> 02:52.100
Well, Yunxiao...

02:55.190 --> 02:56.690
I knew all along you weren't dead.

02:57.120 --> 02:58.290
You can't fool me.

02:58.520 --> 02:59.610
So what?

02:59.630 --> 03:00.610
Why slap me?

03:05.910 --> 03:07.890
You promised to help me
find the Pregenesis Sword.

03:08.630 --> 03:10.730
Can you find it this time?

03:11.800 --> 03:13.570
I think so.

03:14.190 --> 03:14.980
From now on,

03:15.400 --> 03:17.170
I want to know all your plans.

03:20.840 --> 03:21.940
Or I'll kill you.

03:24.030 --> 03:24.820
Sure.

03:29.500 --> 03:32.420
[Episode 14]

03:37.960 --> 03:39.540
I'm Bian Zhuang, Lord of Horizon Hall.

03:42.870 --> 03:45.340
I'm here to ask for help.

03:50.910 --> 03:53.290
You boasted so boldly before,

03:53.520 --> 03:56.380
saying that in the South Sea,

03:56.560 --> 03:57.500
you were a deity,

03:58.000 --> 04:00.340
so you wouldn't need our help.

04:03.470 --> 04:05.220
I taught you the Sea Demon stratagem.

04:06.030 --> 04:07.610
It should have been flawless.

04:07.800 --> 04:09.540
Why then was Bear Island lost?

04:10.840 --> 04:11.730
As you expected,

04:11.870 --> 04:12.890
Changgeng broke

04:12.910 --> 04:14.130
the South Sea stratagem

04:14.310 --> 04:15.260
and struck me.

04:16.830 --> 04:17.810
Changgeng?

04:20.680 --> 04:22.100
If it's him,

04:23.390 --> 04:25.340
you have reinforcements at hand.

04:39.040 --> 04:40.100
Jiang Si'er.

04:41.750 --> 04:42.930
Yunxiao.

04:44.430 --> 04:45.340
The Human Clan.

04:50.190 --> 04:51.410
Changgeng.

04:55.830 --> 04:56.610
Move!

04:58.270 --> 04:59.610
Stop fighting!

04:59.720 --> 05:00.410
Get up.

05:01.160 --> 05:02.290
Why are you fighting?

05:03.160 --> 05:04.100
You go dig sweet potatoes.

05:04.390 --> 05:05.410
You go dry the fish.

05:08.390 --> 05:09.290
Leave!

05:18.510 --> 05:19.140
Who is it?

05:23.000 --> 05:23.460
Father.

05:24.360 --> 05:25.490
I'm late today.

05:25.600 --> 05:26.930
May I join now?

05:27.070 --> 05:27.980
Of course.

05:28.000 --> 05:29.050
We've already started.

05:29.070 --> 05:29.980
Come on, come on.

05:35.600 --> 05:36.100
Ke Le'er.

05:36.750 --> 05:37.540
Here you are!

05:39.390 --> 05:40.340
I did a painting.

05:40.360 --> 05:41.250
Do you want to see it?

05:41.270 --> 05:42.100
Maybe next time.

05:42.270 --> 05:43.250
Next time for sure.

05:44.600 --> 05:45.220
Well.

05:45.480 --> 05:46.930
I've composed a new poem.

05:48.040 --> 05:50.250
In the past, we were so close.

05:50.270 --> 05:51.370
Alright, Hua.

05:51.390 --> 05:52.460
I'm busy.

05:52.510 --> 05:54.460
I'm busy overseeing the statue
of Changgeng the Great.

05:54.720 --> 05:55.250
Next time.

05:55.270 --> 05:55.850
Next time, for sure.

06:04.430 --> 06:05.850
Changgeng, Changgeng.

06:06.190 --> 06:07.490
All you talk about is Changgeng.

06:07.630 --> 06:08.730
I'm right here.

06:08.750 --> 06:10.050
Won't you chat with me?

06:10.120 --> 06:11.100
What's wrong, Hua?

06:11.270 --> 06:12.490
Why are you so angry all of a sudden?

06:12.680 --> 06:13.930
All of a sudden?

06:14.430 --> 06:15.700
Why am I so angry?

06:16.270 --> 06:17.460
You no longer watch me paint

06:17.480 --> 06:18.700
or listen to my poems.

06:19.240 --> 06:20.900
You always think of Changgeng.

06:20.920 --> 06:22.100
What's so great about him?

06:23.720 --> 06:25.460
Why so petty, Hua?

06:26.430 --> 06:27.490
I'm petty?

06:29.000 --> 06:29.780
You...

06:30.040 --> 06:31.140
Look at Changgeng the Great.

06:31.270 --> 06:33.250
He saved the world.

06:33.270 --> 06:34.100
Now, look at yourself.

06:34.240 --> 06:35.700
Besides painting and poetry,

06:35.720 --> 06:36.700
what else have you done?

06:38.040 --> 06:38.660
No more chatting.

06:38.680 --> 06:39.540
I'm going to work.

06:49.800 --> 06:51.140
I can only paint, huh?

06:52.480 --> 06:54.020
I just don't let you

06:54.240 --> 06:55.460
see me working.

06:59.830 --> 07:01.460
That one's too thin.

07:02.240 --> 07:03.730
It'll capsize as a raft.

07:08.430 --> 07:10.490
That one's too thick; you can't chop it.

07:19.830 --> 07:20.610
This one.

07:21.000 --> 07:22.020
This one's good.

07:26.240 --> 07:27.020
Well.

07:27.800 --> 07:29.810
I wasn't going to raft away.

07:29.870 --> 07:32.140
The Westdawn Sect is tremendous karma.

07:32.190 --> 07:33.410
Getting tangled in this karma,

07:33.430 --> 07:35.780
you can't stay on Bear Island anymore.

07:36.240 --> 07:38.460
Before this karma amplifies,

07:38.480 --> 07:39.850
you need to leave here asap

07:39.870 --> 07:42.020
to find another secluded place,

07:42.040 --> 07:43.930
change your face, hide your name,

07:44.070 --> 07:46.100
and live on without any karma.

07:49.720 --> 07:51.020
I knew it.

07:51.480 --> 07:53.100
You and I are the same.

07:53.120 --> 07:54.290
Absolutely.

07:55.190 --> 07:56.140
Speaking of dodging karma,

07:56.360 --> 07:59.220
I'm second to none.

08:02.430 --> 08:03.810
But I think

08:04.310 --> 08:06.020
if you leave Bear Island,

08:06.160 --> 08:07.700
you might never find

08:07.720 --> 08:09.410
a place like Bear Island

08:09.510 --> 08:11.900
that lets you hide
from those seeking you.

08:15.240 --> 08:16.250
How do you know

08:17.600 --> 08:18.700
someone is after me?

08:20.430 --> 08:22.610
Not only do I know that,

08:23.000 --> 08:24.730
but I know who it is.

08:25.160 --> 08:26.050
I even know

08:26.240 --> 08:27.660
who you are.

08:35.320 --> 08:36.100
Alright.

08:36.600 --> 08:37.370
Bai.

08:38.390 --> 08:40.530
I knew from the first moment I saw you

08:41.750 --> 08:43.250
that you're no ordinary person.

08:43.270 --> 08:44.060
Alright.

08:44.510 --> 08:46.220
For the sake of our brotherhood

08:46.910 --> 08:48.060
and our fated bond,

08:48.550 --> 08:50.460
we'll help each other from now on

08:51.200 --> 08:52.300
and roam together.

08:52.840 --> 08:55.060
With my wisdom and your strength,

08:55.080 --> 08:58.420
we'll live carefree and unrestrained.

08:59.550 --> 09:00.340
Come on.

09:01.240 --> 09:02.890
First, help me chop down this tree.

09:06.550 --> 09:07.700
Are you really leaving?

09:09.200 --> 09:10.060
Of course.

09:11.080 --> 09:12.300
Fortunately, they now

09:12.750 --> 09:13.650
all revere Changgeng,

09:13.670 --> 09:14.850
not me.

09:15.750 --> 09:17.130
If something happens in the future,

09:17.360 --> 09:18.940
let Changgeng take the blame.

09:19.630 --> 09:20.530
It's none of our concern.

09:20.790 --> 09:22.060
Have you considered

09:22.480 --> 09:23.650
that if the Westdawn Sect

09:24.550 --> 09:25.820
comes for revenge after you leave,

09:26.240 --> 09:27.650
what can the locals do?

09:28.600 --> 09:30.890
They brought this karma on themselves.

09:31.630 --> 09:32.700
Whether they live or die,

09:33.870 --> 09:34.730
it's none of my business.

09:35.030 --> 09:35.850
It's all the Fated Mandate.

09:35.870 --> 09:36.650
Fated Mandate?

09:37.480 --> 09:38.890
The Fated Mandate wants them dead?

09:45.630 --> 09:46.850
Being Grandlord must be tough.

09:47.320 --> 09:48.130
How would I know?

09:48.270 --> 09:48.940
I'm not the real one...

09:48.960 --> 09:50.250
You have to handle

09:50.270 --> 09:51.650
so many trivial matters every day.

09:51.670 --> 09:52.890
If you can't manage them all,

09:53.080 --> 09:54.340
they will curse you.

09:56.150 --> 09:58.420
But indeed, so many trivial matters.

09:58.670 --> 10:00.890
How could you manage all this alone?

10:01.320 --> 10:02.100
Besides,

10:02.120 --> 10:03.530
you have Fate above you.

10:03.630 --> 10:04.940
Whatever Fate does,

10:05.240 --> 10:06.490
you're helpless to stop it.

10:07.320 --> 10:08.610
So, you think:

10:09.270 --> 10:10.890
Since you'll be cursed anyway...

10:11.000 --> 10:11.940
Everything you do

10:11.960 --> 10:13.420
will get you cursed.

10:13.440 --> 10:14.250
All your effort

10:14.270 --> 10:15.420
is pointless.

10:15.440 --> 10:17.460
So, you might as well
just let them curse.

10:18.200 --> 10:18.980
Right?

10:21.390 --> 10:23.220
Have you witnessed samsara?

10:23.670 --> 10:25.940
Have you heard ghosts wail in hell?

10:28.600 --> 10:30.890
Have you seen the human world's grief?

10:38.910 --> 10:39.650
Right.

10:40.600 --> 10:41.340
Let them curse

10:41.360 --> 10:42.650
to their heart's content.

10:43.910 --> 10:45.300
Why do I have to meddle

10:45.390 --> 10:46.700
in their Fated Mandate?

10:47.440 --> 10:48.220
Fine.

10:48.320 --> 10:49.610
At worst, I'll just quit.

10:49.750 --> 10:50.730
What can happen to me?

10:53.390 --> 10:56.460
But you still love
all the living beings.

11:02.360 --> 11:04.100
When I first came to this island,

11:04.790 --> 11:06.650
I saw you on that cliff

11:06.870 --> 11:10.060
writing poems, painting, creating.

11:10.080 --> 11:12.100
Though it wasn't really good,

11:12.240 --> 11:14.220
I could still see from them

11:14.240 --> 11:15.980
your love for this land

11:16.000 --> 11:17.530
and your affection for the people here.

11:17.870 --> 11:19.250
You love the locals

11:19.270 --> 11:22.370
who once accepted you,

11:22.390 --> 11:23.700
believed in you,

11:23.910 --> 11:26.340
betrayed you,

11:26.360 --> 11:27.490
and then believed in you again.

11:27.670 --> 11:28.820
If the Westdawn Sect

11:28.870 --> 11:31.060
kills them all after you leave,

11:31.080 --> 11:32.890
will you still say

11:32.910 --> 11:34.220
with such confidence

11:34.240 --> 11:36.100
that it's their Fated Mandate?

11:53.150 --> 11:53.940
The Fated Mandate

11:54.670 --> 11:55.940
is not for me to decide.

12:14.540 --> 12:18.820
[Forbidden Land]

12:26.840 --> 12:27.610
This is it.

12:29.320 --> 12:31.650
You two saved us.

12:31.720 --> 12:32.700
In return,

12:33.030 --> 12:36.610
I'll lead you into the Forbidden Land.

12:37.270 --> 12:39.490
But I must warn you:

12:39.630 --> 12:42.700
What you want is probably not here.

12:42.870 --> 12:44.250
Just get us inside.

12:44.550 --> 12:45.610
Leave the rest to us.

12:45.630 --> 12:46.340
Alright.

12:47.120 --> 12:47.890
By the way,

12:48.150 --> 12:49.300
I forgot to tell you:

12:49.550 --> 12:53.100
Up ahead, there are traps.

12:53.270 --> 12:55.460
So, follow me closely.

12:56.080 --> 12:57.100
Follow

12:57.360 --> 12:59.420
my every move.

13:00.080 --> 13:01.420
Don't make any mistakes.

13:02.030 --> 13:03.100
Come on, watch closely.

13:05.000 --> 13:05.890
Watch carefully now.

13:12.630 --> 13:13.420
Right foot.

13:18.390 --> 13:19.180
Come.

13:32.670 --> 13:33.700
Clever.

13:43.600 --> 13:44.370
A sword mark.

13:45.120 --> 13:46.490
Where's the sword stuck here?

13:46.630 --> 13:48.300
Only the sword stone is here.

13:48.790 --> 13:50.010
No sword.

13:50.270 --> 13:51.530
We've guarded

13:51.630 --> 13:53.010
this place

13:53.030 --> 13:54.340
for generations.

13:54.480 --> 13:56.700
We've never heard any elder say

13:57.120 --> 13:59.850
there's a sword stuck in this stone.

14:02.390 --> 14:03.530
That shouldn't be.

14:04.440 --> 14:06.420
This Bear Island
can nullify all magical power.

14:07.000 --> 14:08.890
That must be
the Pregenesis Sword's doing.

14:10.510 --> 14:13.130
You see,

14:13.150 --> 14:14.530
we've guarded this island

14:14.750 --> 14:17.220
for a millennium,

14:17.480 --> 14:19.850
completely cut off from the outside.

14:20.080 --> 14:23.220
Many things just faded away.

14:23.720 --> 14:25.100
But let me tell you.

14:25.150 --> 14:26.890
Ever since I can remember,

14:27.750 --> 14:29.700
my grandfather told me

14:30.080 --> 14:31.370
that on this island,

14:31.390 --> 14:34.130
there are only rocks, no sword.

14:38.200 --> 14:39.490
Have you brought Bian Zhuang here?

14:39.550 --> 14:41.650
Yes.

14:42.360 --> 14:43.460
But he said

14:43.870 --> 14:45.220
that the sword is

14:45.600 --> 14:47.820
in another secret passage around here.

14:47.910 --> 14:48.700
So,

14:48.750 --> 14:51.060
he had us digging up rocks

14:51.080 --> 14:52.220
day and night.

14:52.360 --> 14:53.340
I see.

14:54.200 --> 14:55.530
No wonder Bian Zhuang said

14:55.840 --> 14:58.250
that he's already tried
everything we thought of.

14:58.270 --> 14:59.940
The Pregenesis Sword
must be on this island.

14:59.960 --> 15:02.220
If it's not here, I'll look elsewhere.

15:07.550 --> 15:08.700
After all morning,

15:09.200 --> 15:10.460
I finally achieved something.

15:19.720 --> 15:20.820
It looks nice.

15:23.270 --> 15:24.530
But it's not practical enough.

15:25.550 --> 15:26.340
Again.

15:48.790 --> 15:50.650
I didn't expect karma to come so fast.

15:51.030 --> 15:52.980
You said you killed the Sea Demon.

15:53.000 --> 15:53.940
Then what is this?

15:58.790 --> 15:59.940
Sea Demon, Sea Demon.

15:59.960 --> 16:00.580
The Sea Demon's coming!

16:00.580 --> 16:01.500
- Run, hurry!
- The Sea Demon's dead.

16:01.500 --> 16:02.370
Exactly.

16:02.390 --> 16:03.770
There is no Sea Demon.

16:03.790 --> 16:04.420
Sea Demon.

16:05.080 --> 16:06.250
The Sea Demon's coming!

16:06.270 --> 16:07.220
Run, hurry!

16:07.790 --> 16:08.940
- What are you saying?
- What?

16:09.720 --> 16:10.370
A big Sea Demon.

16:10.390 --> 16:11.890
The Sea Demon's coming!

16:11.910 --> 16:14.010
Every member of Bear Stockade

16:14.030 --> 16:16.010
must train vigorously every day.

16:16.030 --> 16:16.730
Have you remembered that?

16:16.750 --> 16:17.460
The Sea Demon is here!

16:17.480 --> 16:18.530
Run, quickly!

16:19.150 --> 16:20.010
Why the panic?

16:20.030 --> 16:20.700
Why the panic?

16:20.720 --> 16:21.820
Why are you just standing there?

16:21.960 --> 16:24.010
Hurry, run! It'll be too late!

16:24.030 --> 16:25.770
We believe in the Sea Deity Sect.

16:25.790 --> 16:27.300
We can defeat the Sea Demon.

16:27.440 --> 16:28.180
That's right!

16:28.200 --> 16:29.610
We can beat the Sea Demon.

16:29.630 --> 16:30.770
No, you can't.

16:30.790 --> 16:32.340
Even if we can't,

16:32.360 --> 16:34.940
Changgeng the Great will save us.

16:34.960 --> 16:36.250
That's right!

16:36.270 --> 16:37.490
Exactly, we have Changgeng the Great.

16:37.510 --> 16:39.650
What now? Will you intervene?

16:40.720 --> 16:42.060
I must get five li from Bear Island.

16:42.080 --> 16:43.420
Only then can I use magical power.

16:44.360 --> 16:45.300
If I go out now,

16:45.360 --> 16:46.820
I'll be spotted at the coast.

16:46.840 --> 16:47.820
Hua! Hua!

16:47.960 --> 16:49.530
Aren't you the Grandlord
of the Sea Deity Sect?

16:49.550 --> 16:51.340
Now, call upon Changgeng the Great.

16:51.360 --> 16:51.980
Have him drive off the Sea Demon.

16:52.000 --> 16:53.010
Then, we'll be saved!

16:53.030 --> 16:54.420
Yes, call him!

16:54.440 --> 16:55.100
I...

16:55.270 --> 16:56.340
Why are you stammering?

16:56.910 --> 16:57.850
No, I...

16:57.870 --> 16:59.220
Call him! Do it!

17:00.080 --> 17:00.770
Summon him!

17:00.790 --> 17:02.010
Just summon Changgeng the Great!

17:02.120 --> 17:02.650
Yes!

17:02.670 --> 17:03.980
Go on, call him!

17:06.270 --> 17:07.010
Hua?

17:07.480 --> 17:09.490
Hurry, summon Changgeng the Great!

17:13.510 --> 17:14.290
I'm sorry.

17:15.400 --> 17:16.700
I'm no Grandlord.

17:16.750 --> 17:18.250
There never was a Sea Deity Sect.

17:18.270 --> 17:19.290
It was all a lie.

17:19.310 --> 17:20.420
No way.

17:20.920 --> 17:22.730
I know I was wrong.

17:22.790 --> 17:25.010
I shouldn't have lied to save my skin.

17:25.030 --> 17:26.090
But you must believe me.

17:26.550 --> 17:27.900
The Sea Demon is really coming.

17:28.110 --> 17:28.940
Run, quickly!

17:28.960 --> 17:30.860
Or it'll be too late!

17:31.590 --> 17:32.810
What is he saying?

17:32.830 --> 17:33.620
Impossible!

17:33.750 --> 17:35.770
Changgeng the Great repelled
the Sea Demon

17:35.790 --> 17:37.180
and drove off the false deity.

17:37.200 --> 17:38.250
We all saw it with our own eyes, right?

17:38.270 --> 17:38.810
Right!

17:38.830 --> 17:40.140
How could that be fake?

17:40.160 --> 17:42.770
Changgeng the Great cares
for all people.

17:42.790 --> 17:44.140
It must be
because we're not devout enough.

17:44.160 --> 17:44.770
Let's go pray

17:44.790 --> 17:46.330
at Changgeng the Great's idol now.

17:46.350 --> 17:47.770
He will hear and surely come to save us.

17:48.310 --> 17:49.140
Go.

17:49.160 --> 17:49.810
Go pray, go pray.

17:49.830 --> 17:50.900
Don't go!

17:51.590 --> 17:52.700
Please, don't go!

17:52.750 --> 17:53.860
You really shouldn't go.

17:53.880 --> 17:55.250
Stay here and wait!

18:09.160 --> 18:10.050
It's all your fault.

18:10.830 --> 18:13.290
You got me to be the Grandlord.

18:14.240 --> 18:15.660
You made me lie to everyone.

18:15.680 --> 18:17.250
You drew the Sea Demon here.

18:17.270 --> 18:18.180
It's all your fault.

18:18.200 --> 18:18.980
Let him go!

18:19.240 --> 18:20.250
If Bear Stockade falls,

18:21.030 --> 18:23.620
I'll make you suffer eternal damnation.

18:48.310 --> 18:50.290
Have you seen waves towering to the sky?

18:54.350 --> 18:55.290
Changgeng,

18:56.240 --> 18:59.250
let's see where you flee.

18:59.480 --> 19:01.570
This time, we joined forces
with Horizon Hall

19:01.590 --> 19:03.460
to crush the South Sea demons.

19:03.480 --> 19:05.620
We'll restore East Sea's former glory

19:05.720 --> 19:08.050
and reclaim the Crown Prince's place
in the Dragon Palace!

19:08.110 --> 19:08.900
Yes!

19:09.550 --> 19:10.140
Charge!

19:14.480 --> 19:15.220
Get up now.

19:15.920 --> 19:16.770
Go, go.

19:19.200 --> 19:20.090
Hurry, get up!

19:20.750 --> 19:22.250
- Go away.
- Leave us alone.

19:22.720 --> 19:23.620
- Run!
- What are you doing?

19:23.640 --> 19:24.810
Go! What's wrong with you?

19:24.830 --> 19:26.220
Just leave!

19:26.240 --> 19:26.770
Go right now.

19:26.790 --> 19:27.700
All of you, get up!

19:27.720 --> 19:29.460
Don't just sit there, or you'll die!

19:30.550 --> 19:31.050
Ke Le'er,

19:31.070 --> 19:32.660
you know I want to save you.

19:32.680 --> 19:33.460
Get up and come with me.

19:33.480 --> 19:34.900
Alright. Hua.

19:34.920 --> 19:35.490
If you wish to leave,

19:35.510 --> 19:36.530
you can leave on your own.

19:36.680 --> 19:37.570
Don't let your mischief

19:37.590 --> 19:39.620
keep Changgeng the Great
from hearing us.

19:39.640 --> 19:40.050
Exactly.

19:40.070 --> 19:40.940
Right.

19:40.960 --> 19:43.140
We're about to pray
to Changgeng the Great.

19:43.160 --> 19:44.050
My mischief?

19:44.070 --> 19:45.940
I could have left you all behind.

19:45.960 --> 19:48.090
I could have run
before the Sea Demon came.

19:48.350 --> 19:50.090
But Hua, weren't you

19:50.270 --> 19:53.290
cutting down trees to build a raft?

19:53.310 --> 19:54.770
Every word you say is a lie.

19:54.790 --> 19:56.940
Liar! You're nothing but a liar!

19:56.960 --> 19:58.940
Liar! Liar!

19:58.960 --> 20:01.220
Liar! Liar!

20:01.240 --> 20:03.140
Well, not every word was a lie.

20:03.160 --> 20:04.050
Hua,

20:04.070 --> 20:06.140
if you want to go,
just leave on your own.

20:06.160 --> 20:07.010
What we need now

20:07.030 --> 20:08.490
is Changgeng the Great to appear.

20:08.510 --> 20:09.660
All we need is Changgeng the Great.

20:09.680 --> 20:10.380
Changgeng?

20:11.550 --> 20:12.980
Who cares about Changgeng the Great?

20:13.000 --> 20:13.530
Compared to me, he's nothing.

20:13.550 --> 20:14.660
He's less than a strand of hair.

20:14.680 --> 20:15.460
What are you talking about?

20:15.640 --> 20:17.660
You think having a statue built for you

20:17.680 --> 20:18.700
makes you a deity?

20:18.720 --> 20:20.250
Do you know what a deity is?

20:20.400 --> 20:22.620
Do you know the burden deities bear

20:22.640 --> 20:24.090
and the trials they must endure?

20:24.400 --> 20:25.460
You don't deserve it!

20:25.720 --> 20:26.770
Don't insult Changgeng the Great!

20:26.790 --> 20:27.770
- Exactly!
- Stop talking nonsense!

20:27.790 --> 20:28.460
What are you saying?

20:28.480 --> 20:29.220
Don't?

20:29.720 --> 20:31.140
I insulted him. So what?

20:31.480 --> 20:32.700
If you're so capable,

20:32.720 --> 20:34.220
say something back!

20:38.350 --> 20:39.860
Changgeng the Great has appeared!

20:40.000 --> 20:40.900
Changgeng the Great.

20:40.920 --> 20:44.090
Everyone! Level 1 tsunami warning.

20:44.110 --> 20:46.810
Evacuate to the Forbidden Land now!

20:51.750 --> 20:53.660
Alright, everyone, listen to me.

20:53.750 --> 20:54.330
We...

20:59.440 --> 21:01.460
What's your next move?

21:03.720 --> 21:04.490
Don't worry.

21:06.160 --> 21:07.090
I have a plan.

21:23.000 --> 21:23.770
Where are they?

21:23.770 --> 21:25.500
[Forbidden Land]

21:26.640 --> 21:27.420
Wait.

21:30.400 --> 21:31.420
There's a trap ahead.

21:31.640 --> 21:33.860
Charge! Charge!

21:44.680 --> 21:46.290
Does this trap have no dignity?

21:46.790 --> 21:47.810
Now, I know why

21:47.830 --> 21:49.810
the Pregenesis Sword
chose them as guards.

21:49.830 --> 21:50.810
That makes sense.

21:55.680 --> 21:56.330
Sit, sit.

21:56.350 --> 21:58.570
Lingli, you always eat the least.

21:58.590 --> 21:59.860
- Look, you're hurt.
- Exactly.

22:00.070 --> 22:00.940
What happened?

22:00.960 --> 22:02.250
I don't know either.

22:02.270 --> 22:03.050
Don't touch it!

22:04.750 --> 22:05.570
Lingli.

22:06.000 --> 22:08.460
Father.

22:08.480 --> 22:10.220
My daughter...

22:11.200 --> 22:12.570
- It hurts so much!
- What happened to your leg?

22:13.000 --> 22:14.290
My daughter...

22:14.590 --> 22:16.330
It breaks my heart to see you like this.

22:16.350 --> 22:17.700
Who did this to you?

22:32.960 --> 22:35.380
My heart is bleeding.

22:35.960 --> 22:36.810
Father.

22:39.070 --> 22:39.900
This is...

22:40.590 --> 22:40.980
That's right.

22:43.200 --> 22:44.050
You've been hiding something from me.

22:44.480 --> 22:47.180
If Ancestral Witch heirs want to use
the Pregenesis Sword to rebel,

22:48.240 --> 22:49.810
the entire Witch Clan will have

22:50.640 --> 22:51.810
to drench Bear Island in blood.

22:51.920 --> 22:53.570
Drench Bear Island in blood?

22:53.590 --> 22:55.810
Someone feared the locals
might steal the Sword,

22:56.440 --> 22:57.940
so they sealed the Sword.

22:57.960 --> 22:58.330
Exactly.

22:59.590 --> 23:00.860
That's why

23:01.000 --> 23:02.220
we can't see the Sword.

23:02.590 --> 23:04.330
So, if we break the seal,

23:04.550 --> 23:05.900
we can restore our magical power?

23:05.960 --> 23:06.980
Yunxiao, do you remember

23:07.310 --> 23:08.980
a secret art that uses blood as a key?

23:09.160 --> 23:10.380
The ancient Blood Sacrifice Art.

23:10.510 --> 23:11.290
I know what you mean.

23:11.680 --> 23:12.460
The people of Bear Stockade

23:13.070 --> 23:14.250
are the Ancestral Witch heirs.

23:14.550 --> 23:16.380
If we gather the blood
of all Bear Stockade people,

23:16.680 --> 23:18.050
Bear Island will be stained...

23:18.350 --> 23:19.770
With the blood of the entire Witch Clan.

23:36.200 --> 23:36.980
That is to say,

23:39.830 --> 23:41.770
as long as everyone
gives a drop of blood...

23:41.790 --> 23:42.570
Blood?

23:42.590 --> 23:44.420
We can defeat the Sea Demon!

23:48.480 --> 23:49.140
A drop of blood?

23:49.880 --> 24:00.810
Defeat the Sea Demon!

24:00.880 --> 24:01.980
Where's Hua?

24:02.000 --> 24:02.980
Defeat the Sea Demon!

24:21.110 --> 24:21.900
You?

24:21.920 --> 24:24.980
Demons and monsters, retreat at once!

24:25.880 --> 24:27.660
Do not harm the people of Bear Stockade.

24:28.070 --> 24:29.140
If you refuse,

24:29.350 --> 24:31.460
I'll make sure you never reincarnate!

24:31.480 --> 24:32.620
Who do you think you are?

24:32.640 --> 24:34.050
Putting on a show here.

24:34.400 --> 24:35.810
I am Celestial Emperor,

24:36.350 --> 24:37.570
Lord of the Celestial Court,

24:37.590 --> 24:40.810
ruler of heaven, earth,

24:41.240 --> 24:42.530
and mortals.

24:47.200 --> 24:51.460
Celestial Emperor?
Lord of the Celestial Court?

24:55.440 --> 24:56.220
Boy.

24:57.200 --> 24:58.250
I'll spare your life.

24:59.400 --> 25:00.420
Now, get lost.

25:05.000 --> 25:06.700
A single strike

25:08.070 --> 25:09.330
from the axe in my hand

25:10.480 --> 25:11.860
can split Mount Hua.

25:20.960 --> 25:21.980
It's hollow.

25:29.880 --> 25:30.900
Boy.

25:31.680 --> 25:33.700
You're pushing your luck.

25:34.200 --> 25:36.980
Demons and monsters, back off now!

25:37.680 --> 25:39.140
I'll spare your life.

25:57.550 --> 25:58.530
I won't kill you

25:58.750 --> 25:59.980
only because I don't want Le'er
to be sad.

26:00.960 --> 26:02.290
Don't ask for trouble.

26:04.400 --> 26:05.010
Go.

26:05.680 --> 26:06.460
Charge and kill!

26:13.350 --> 26:14.460
As I said,

26:15.680 --> 26:17.860
you can't harm the Bear Stockade people.

26:20.350 --> 26:22.290
Not high enough. You go smash him!

26:24.550 --> 26:25.570
There's no blood either.

26:26.590 --> 26:27.620
You go smash him!

26:27.790 --> 26:29.420
All that running. Smash!

26:29.550 --> 26:31.140
Their skin is too thick.

26:31.680 --> 26:33.290
Your rock is bigger than his.

26:33.310 --> 26:34.530
That's unfair.

26:35.200 --> 26:37.220
Hua! Hua!

26:38.830 --> 26:40.900
Why lose your way now?

26:56.720 --> 26:58.010
Why put yourself through this?

26:58.310 --> 26:59.980
I spared your life once.

27:00.310 --> 27:01.330
Just run away.

27:02.440 --> 27:03.570
So stubborn.

27:11.790 --> 27:12.570
Let go.

27:14.510 --> 27:15.570
Let go!

27:17.200 --> 27:18.180
I am...

27:19.000 --> 27:21.090
Celestial Emperor.

27:21.590 --> 27:23.050
You cannot pass!

27:23.790 --> 27:24.730
Unless

27:25.070 --> 27:26.730
you kill me.

27:29.240 --> 27:30.420
Are you insane?

27:33.200 --> 27:34.530
Let me try.

27:42.000 --> 27:43.290
Not much blood.

28:02.920 --> 28:03.810
Not enough yet.

28:17.000 --> 28:17.900
Hua.

28:18.790 --> 28:20.490
Le'er, how did you

28:21.590 --> 28:22.380
get here?

28:22.830 --> 28:23.620
Hua.

28:24.880 --> 28:26.730
Hua, are you alright?

28:28.880 --> 28:29.730
Ke Le'er.

28:31.920 --> 28:32.700
Hua.

28:33.270 --> 28:34.050
Ke Le'er.

28:35.440 --> 28:36.330
Hua.

28:37.000 --> 28:39.250
Tell me.

28:40.790 --> 28:41.860
Am I

28:43.350 --> 28:45.180
a great hero?

28:47.510 --> 28:48.290
Yes.

28:50.310 --> 28:51.420
You are a great hero.

29:04.960 --> 29:05.730
Hua.

29:07.880 --> 29:08.660
Hua.

29:09.790 --> 29:10.530
Hua!

29:18.400 --> 29:20.090
Alright, Changgeng.

29:22.960 --> 29:23.730
Come out.

29:24.960 --> 29:26.620
Er, think of something.

29:35.270 --> 29:36.050
You...

29:36.680 --> 29:37.460
You...

29:37.590 --> 29:38.810
It'll be quick. Just bear with it.

29:49.790 --> 29:51.050
That was quick.

30:13.350 --> 30:15.290
The Sword's been sealed for too long;
it's cracked.

30:34.440 --> 30:35.770
Hua!

31:04.070 --> 31:06.380
Give Le'er back to me!

31:08.880 --> 31:10.090
Give her back!

31:14.830 --> 31:16.900
You reckless little dragon!

31:17.400 --> 31:19.250
You can't even recognize your own kind.

31:35.350 --> 31:36.220
So, you are

31:36.920 --> 31:38.220
the Princess of the Dragon Clan.

31:40.880 --> 31:41.530
Le'er,

31:41.920 --> 31:43.700
I believe true love transcends race.

31:43.880 --> 31:44.420
Le'er,

31:44.920 --> 31:45.700
wait for me!

31:47.200 --> 31:48.530
Were you waiting for me?

31:54.510 --> 31:55.460
Fairy Yunxiao.

31:58.350 --> 31:59.140
The Pregenesis Sword.

32:03.790 --> 32:04.660
Stop, stop! Don't hit me!

32:04.680 --> 32:05.460
Yunxiao, don't hit me!

32:05.510 --> 32:07.220
I've always been on your side.

32:07.350 --> 32:09.490
You're right; we're not enemies.

32:09.880 --> 32:10.900
That's more like it.

32:11.030 --> 32:12.460
Your true enemy

32:12.480 --> 32:13.420
is him.

32:15.270 --> 32:16.330
I heard

32:17.030 --> 32:18.620
that you're looking for me.

32:19.550 --> 32:20.770
Changgeng.

32:42.830 --> 32:43.730
Your Highness.

32:43.750 --> 32:44.900
Your Highness, are you all right?

32:50.270 --> 32:51.250
I never thought

32:51.640 --> 32:52.460
the South Sea

32:53.160 --> 32:54.700
would have such a mighty dragon.

33:00.590 --> 33:03.050
I am Ao Jia, Crown Prince of East Sea.

33:04.000 --> 33:05.330
May I ask your name?

33:05.920 --> 33:07.620
Come visit East Sea someday.

33:07.680 --> 33:09.090
We can spar.

33:09.110 --> 33:09.940
Again?

33:33.550 --> 33:34.940
Why do you keep running?

33:34.960 --> 33:35.980
Why do you keep fighting?

33:36.240 --> 33:37.570
I'm going to fight you!

33:43.240 --> 33:44.180
Stop running.

33:46.510 --> 33:46.940
Freeze.

33:54.070 --> 33:56.380
Since you've seen my true face,

33:56.830 --> 33:59.460
I can't just let you leave.

34:05.030 --> 34:06.490
Do you know what mosaic is?

34:48.710 --> 34:49.380
Alright.

34:51.280 --> 34:52.050
What's going on?

34:52.070 --> 34:54.940
Are you feeling anything off right now?

34:55.030 --> 34:55.940
Like

34:56.670 --> 34:58.490
dizziness, blurred vision,

34:58.510 --> 35:00.210
or nausea.

35:03.070 --> 35:03.860
How did you know?

35:07.800 --> 35:08.780
What did you do to me?

35:09.510 --> 35:10.300
Guess.

35:12.110 --> 35:13.050
You're full of tricks.

35:14.510 --> 35:15.490
Just you wait.

35:16.320 --> 35:19.050
Changgeng's here! Help!

35:19.150 --> 35:22.300
Changgeng's here! Catch him!

35:22.320 --> 35:23.820
Changgeng's here!

35:26.320 --> 35:27.820
He ran away!

35:53.630 --> 35:54.650
Something's not right.

36:02.150 --> 36:02.940
This...

36:05.630 --> 36:06.420
Who is it?

36:14.960 --> 36:17.130
I am Celestial Emperor,

36:17.760 --> 36:19.090
Lord of the Celestial Court,

36:20.110 --> 36:22.860
ruler of heaven, earth,

36:22.880 --> 36:24.210
and mortals.

36:32.800 --> 36:33.690
You're serious?

36:34.440 --> 36:35.210
This time,

36:36.480 --> 36:37.300
do you believe me?

36:38.190 --> 36:39.460
You knew about this all along?

36:39.840 --> 36:41.610
I just found out recently too.

36:41.670 --> 36:42.610
He really is...?

36:42.630 --> 36:43.300
Yes.

36:43.320 --> 36:43.980
Then we...

36:44.000 --> 36:44.690
That's right.

36:47.070 --> 36:48.340
You're quite bold.

36:50.000 --> 36:51.010
I think so too.

36:53.590 --> 36:54.260
Bian Zhuang,

36:55.480 --> 36:57.820
you're a mere butterfly spirit.

36:58.400 --> 37:00.530
Yet you oppressed mortals

37:00.880 --> 37:02.460
and defied the Celestial Emperor.

37:02.840 --> 37:04.530
You should be punished.

37:07.510 --> 37:08.410
Fine, fine.

37:09.390 --> 37:10.860
I failed to recognize a real deity.

37:10.880 --> 37:12.020
If you kill me,

37:12.270 --> 37:13.250
the Two Saints of Westdawn

37:13.480 --> 37:15.490
will hold the Celestial Court
to account.

37:15.600 --> 37:16.770
Think

37:17.480 --> 37:18.460
about whether to let me go.

37:18.870 --> 37:20.490
The Two Saints of Westdawn?

37:21.600 --> 37:23.130
Are they rebelling
against the Celestial Court?

37:24.720 --> 37:27.610
Your Celestial Court is
new and unstable.

37:27.630 --> 37:28.740
Think it through.

37:29.470 --> 37:31.810
Will you fall out
with the Westdawn Sect?

37:35.150 --> 37:36.970
Fate is unpredictable.

37:37.560 --> 37:39.050
Fate is merciless.

37:41.030 --> 37:42.290
I'll spare your life.

37:42.710 --> 37:44.860
It's not out of fear
of the Westdawn Sect,

37:45.030 --> 37:46.690
but because you carry

37:47.270 --> 37:49.250
a mission from Fate.

37:51.310 --> 37:52.330
Mission?

37:52.920 --> 37:54.610
Fate arranges all karma

37:55.520 --> 37:57.250
in this world.

37:57.350 --> 37:59.690
When your mission arrives,

38:00.800 --> 38:04.010
I hope you make the right choice.

38:04.350 --> 38:06.250
Of course, of course.

38:07.070 --> 38:07.900
Trust me.

38:08.600 --> 38:09.500
Go now.

38:14.150 --> 38:15.170
In this way,

38:15.190 --> 38:15.650
Yunxiao,

38:16.480 --> 38:17.300
our mission

38:17.320 --> 38:18.490
is finally over.

38:19.760 --> 38:21.610
Now that our magical powers
have returned,

38:21.800 --> 38:23.740
this tiny Bear Island can't hold us.

38:23.800 --> 38:24.980
Next time we meet,

38:25.440 --> 38:26.490
we'll be enemies.

38:27.280 --> 38:28.050
Perhaps

38:28.480 --> 38:30.050
we already are.

38:36.150 --> 38:38.940
So, you only returned

38:39.230 --> 38:41.420
because your goal was
always the Pregenesis Sword.

38:41.440 --> 38:43.170
You never thought to leave all along.

38:43.280 --> 38:45.490
A small problem occurred midway.

38:45.510 --> 38:47.460
But you guessed mostly right.

38:47.480 --> 38:49.260
You never told me
the Blood Sacrifice Art,

38:49.480 --> 38:51.420
because you wanted to seize
the Sword before me.

38:51.440 --> 38:53.530
You were on guard,
never leaving my side.

38:53.550 --> 38:55.090
So, I could hardly make a move.

38:55.110 --> 38:56.460
Bian Zhuang attacked so suddenly

38:56.480 --> 38:57.570
that you had no other choice

38:57.590 --> 38:59.340
but to let me claim the Sword first

38:59.590 --> 39:00.860
and plan to snatch it from me.

39:00.880 --> 39:02.380
Not exactly.

39:02.630 --> 39:04.050
I had a plan all along.

39:04.070 --> 39:06.050
Well, that plan was rather poor.

39:06.110 --> 39:07.260
If it comes to a real fight,

39:07.280 --> 39:08.860
how could you ever be my match?

39:08.880 --> 39:09.940
Yunxiao, you misunderstand.

39:10.070 --> 39:12.050
Why would I fight you alone?

39:14.150 --> 39:15.010
No one

39:15.960 --> 39:17.210
is taking the Sword away.

39:23.320 --> 39:24.820
You must be Fairy Yunxiao.

39:25.150 --> 39:27.260
You must be Celestial Emperor.

39:31.110 --> 39:33.050
To appear alongside Fairy Yunxiao,

39:33.880 --> 39:34.690
you

39:35.440 --> 39:37.050
must be Zhao Gongming.

39:44.880 --> 39:46.260
Forget that. Let's start over.

39:47.320 --> 39:48.530
Sir, you must be

39:49.400 --> 39:50.820
Heavenreach Master.

39:55.800 --> 39:57.610
What? Wrong again?

40:01.880 --> 40:02.780
Introduce yourself.

40:02.800 --> 40:04.780
I'm Li Changshou of Ascendance Sect.

40:05.320 --> 40:06.460
Oh, Changshou.

40:08.590 --> 40:09.610
How embarrassing.

40:10.190 --> 40:10.820
Who is this guy?

40:10.840 --> 40:12.650
Your Majesty, don't fret over who I am.

40:14.070 --> 40:15.900
Rest assured. I'm on your side.

40:16.710 --> 40:17.610
We're on the same side?

40:17.630 --> 40:19.490
Since childhood,
I've admired the Celestial Court.

40:19.510 --> 40:21.570
I've sworn to serve
the Celestial Court with merit.

40:23.320 --> 40:24.650
Well, in that case,

40:25.590 --> 40:28.460
were you the one
who nearly got me burned alive?

40:28.480 --> 40:29.900
Your Majesty, that was to make you

40:29.920 --> 40:31.690
shoulder your responsibilities again

40:31.710 --> 40:34.460
and reawaken your love for the people.

40:36.800 --> 40:38.690
You've certainly gone to great lengths.

40:38.710 --> 40:39.820
The most urgent thing

40:40.000 --> 40:42.010
is to stop her from taking the Sword.

40:42.150 --> 40:43.170
Little rascal, you...

40:43.190 --> 40:44.610
What does she want with the Sword?

40:45.480 --> 40:47.490
She wants to take
the Sea-Calming Pillar.

40:50.280 --> 40:51.170
Do you know

40:51.230 --> 40:52.650
what the consequences are

40:52.670 --> 40:53.860
of taking the Sea-Calming Pillar?

40:54.230 --> 40:55.380
I must have it.

40:56.480 --> 40:57.130
Why?

41:00.150 --> 41:02.340
Because someone greater than you told me

41:02.550 --> 41:03.420
that soon,

41:03.630 --> 41:04.570
the Three Realms will face

41:04.590 --> 41:06.340
a destructive Great Tribulation.

41:08.280 --> 41:09.050
Fate?

41:11.630 --> 41:13.050
You've seen Fate as well?

41:45.510 --> 41:51.290
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

41:51.960 --> 41:58.660
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

42:00.190 --> 42:06.240
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

42:06.870 --> 42:13.320
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

42:14.060 --> 42:21.180
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

42:21.560 --> 42:28.460
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

42:28.840 --> 42:36.190
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

42:36.190 --> 42:43.360
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

42:59.500 --> 43:04.670
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

43:05.760 --> 43:12.780
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

43:13.970 --> 43:19.910
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

43:20.610 --> 43:27.690
♪Alas, our story is short♪

43:28.030 --> 43:35.140
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

43:35.460 --> 43:41.940
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

43:42.720 --> 43:49.930
♪Tears fall, this fate's not done♪

43:50.320 --> 43:58.140
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
